supported by Anthropic. The binary has been patched (Mach-O platform,
embedded strings, credential storage path, libSystem shim) for jailbroken
iOS. Redistribution of a reverse-engineered / binary-modified build may
conflict with Anthropic's terms; packagers and users accept that risk.

Mayflower packaging scripts, the /usr/bin/claude wrapper, and shim.c are
part of the Mayflower project (see the repository LICENSE).
